      "description": "信息面内的聚焦操作。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-focus\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9V4h5m6 0h5v5m0 6v5h-5M9 20H4v-5\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg>聚焦此对象</button>",
